<table>
    <tr><th>SH ID</th><th>Stakeholder</th><th>Role</th><th>Interest</th><th>Influence</th><th>Decisions Made with the Application</th></tr>
    <tr><td><strong>SH-01</strong></td><td>Finance Controller (Noida HQ)</td><td>Project Sponsor & Operational Lead</td><td>Elimination of manual reconciliation lag, precise tracking of debit cash reserves vs. credit obligations.</td><td><span class='badge badge-high'>High</span></td><td>Approves vendor disbursements, determines exact credit balance settlement amounts to prevent interest charges, reallocates cost center budgets.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><strong>SH-02</strong></td><td>Chief Financial Officer (CFO)</td><td>Executive Sponsor</td><td>Optimal working capital management, minimizing credit borrowing costs, and board-level financial reporting.</td><td><span class='badge badge-high'>High</span></td><td>Sets corporate credit card borrowing limits with partner banks, decides reserve capital thresholds, and authorizes capital expenditures.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><strong>SH-03</strong></td><td>Accounts Executive / Data Operator</td><td>Primary End-User</td><td>Automated data ingestion, instant categorization, error-free reconciliation.</td><td><span class='badge badge-med'>Medium</span></td><td>Resolves transaction mismatches, contacts merchants regarding duplicate or rejected charges, flags policy breaches.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><strong>SH-04</strong></td><td>Internal Auditor & Compliance Head</td><td>Governance & Risk Officer</td><td>Zero financial leakage, detection of duplicate billings, audit trail compliance.</td><td><span class='badge badge-high'>High</span></td><td>Initiates formal audit investigations into statistical outlier expenses, enforces corporate card spending guidelines.</td></tr>
